// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Belladonna Vetrano 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2250471757" "Belladonna Vetrano"
// ProfessionString :
"P4091301610" "Assassin"
// DescriptionString :
"P1910933525" "One of the deadliest covert agents in the world, Belladonna has proven herself a most capable spy and killer for the Resistance. Though her past is a well kept secret, Belladonna makes it clear that she has no love for Tyrant or his lackeys. Rumors abound that she was trained by Chimera, Tyrant's Praetor of Intelligence, and is widely considered the deadliest assassin in the world. Belladonna will one day put that title to the test."
// LocationString :
"P2011343611" "???"
// HelloString :
"P2506396973" "Sinclair will <i>pay</i>, {HeroName}. Mark my words."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2445152171" "Players shouldn’t see this."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3003505520" "We've taken Imperial City, {HeroName}. You've done everything you can, for now. We'll meet again on the battlefield to take Cole down once and for all."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2300871738" "Finish up your other tasks, {HeroName}. Then we'll talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P856364347" ""
// IntroString :
"P2049933865" "Introduction"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2066226271" "Intro accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2826310298" "Intro send off"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1060484728" "Introduce one contact"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3673397332" "Introduce two contacts"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page SavedBelladonna Text :
"P1715054068" "<color orange>The following story arc takes place after the events of Dark Astoria and the Dilemma Diabolique trial.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, I'm glad you contacted me. It's been a while, hasn't it? I'm grateful for your help on that rooftop in Imperial City; it almost seems like a lifetime ago when that happened. Back then, Cole's regime was still in power... but now, everything has changed. We no longer need to cower in fear. The power is in <i>our</i> hands.<br><br>The Resistance has become somewhat... split, due to the revelation about Calvin Scott's 'condition'. However, we can't let that get us down. We have the Praetors on the run. There is one last one that we need to deal with: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready?"
// Answer Text :
"P4149465119" "I'm ready, let's begin."
// Page ArrestedBelladonna Text :
"P2076687081" "<color orange>The following story arc takes place after the events of Dark Astoria and the Dilemma Diabolique trial.</color><br><br>{HeroName}. Surprised to see me? After all, when we last met, <i>you</i> handed me over to Praetor Sinclair. I must admit, escaping him wasn't easy, not in the condition I was in, but the time in his prison has made me stronger than ever.<br><br>His followers wanted me to beg for death, but I never gave them the satisfaction. Their deaths bought me my freedom.<br><br>I've been told that you and I need to work together, now that you've become this 'Incarnate'. However, I must know... <i>why</i>, {HeroName}, why did you choose to hand me over to Sinclair?"
// Answer Text :
"P1029011436" "It had to be done. I was trying to stay undercover for the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P3574228908" "I didn't have the power to cross Sinclair. Things are different now."
// Answer Text :
"P743609612" "That's in the past. What's important now is that I'm here to help you."
// Page AnswerOne Text :
"P2317391414" "You were undercover? Hrm...<br><br>Calvin Scott would be insane enough to demand that I go to prison to maintain an agent's cover. I guess it's a good thing that he's been ousted from his position of power.<br><br>This doesn't make us even, {HeroName}, but I can at least begin to understand your motives. Now, on to our current situation. We have the Praetors on the run. There is one loose end that we need to deal with: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready?"
// Page AnswerTwo Text :
"P1526618902" "Power... something that Sinclair valued very much. Things were very different back then. None of us had any hope of standing against the Praetors; they ruled with an iron fist, and all we could do is follow or be destroyed.<br><br>You're right, however. The people from Primal Earth have shown that the Praetors no longer have the power that they used to. I can't forgive you for what you did, but I'm willing to work together to help put a stop to the remains of the regime.<br><br>Most of the Praetors have been defeated, but there is one of them left to deal with: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready?"
// Page AnswerThree Text :
"P983171008" "The past, you say? The past is something very dangerous, {HeroName}. It's something that forges who you are in the present, shapes your beliefs, your motives, your dreams. You're right, the events on that roof <i>are</i> in the past, but they're still shaping you and I at this very minute.<br><br>Perhaps we'll talk about this again in the future, but for now, the Resistance needs your Incarnate power to help us in our final push against the Praetors.<br><br>We've taken care of almost all of Cole's guard. There's only one major player left: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready to help finish this?"
// Page RobertFlores Text :
"P3178186384" "<color orange>The following story arc takes place after the events of Dark Astoria and the Dilemma Diabolique trial.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, I'm glad you contacted me. It's been a while, hasn't it? You were working with that Flores boy, if I'm correct. He's doing quite well, especially now that he isn't standing in the shadow of Cole's regime.<br><br>Robert Flores has been working hard to write report after report of the success that the Resistance and Primals have had against Cole's regime. You see, the power is in <i>our</i> hands now.<br><br>Unfortunately, the Resistance has become somewhat... split, due to the revelation about Calvin Scott's 'condition'. However, we can't let that get us down. We have the Praetors on the run. There is one loose end that we need to deal with: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready?"
// Page Normal Text :
"P3506640944" "<color orange>The following story arc takes place after the events of Dark Astoria and the Dilemma Diabolique trial.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, I'm glad you contacted me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am <color yellow>Belladonna Vetrano</color>, assassin and lieutenant for the Resistance. I'm working with Desdemona and Aurora Borealis towards our final push against the Praetors. You see, the power is in the hands of the Resistance now.<br><br>Unfortunately, the Resistance has become somewhat... split, due to the revelation regarding Calvin Scott's insanity.<br><br>However, we can't let that get us down. We have the Praetors on the run. There is one last one that we need to deal with: <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>. Are you ready?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


