// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Number Six 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1896352296" "Number Six"
// ProfessionString :
"P3390545380" "Super Heroic Computer Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P1923412661" "Dr. Michael Orts, known as Number Six, has a unique ability; he can turn himself into pixilated data and insert himself into any computer in the world, no matter how high tech it is. This power has a downside however; Number Six has a tough time coming <i>back</i>, and his body was permantely turned into metal. Number Six was recently lost for years in a Crey facility until he was recovered with the help of Gaussian and a woman called the Doctor.<br><br>Since then, Vanguard has been employing Number Six to help with their portal technology and with the evacuation of Praetoria."
// LocationString :
"P980288551" "Rikti War Zone"
// HelloString :
"P3377750124" "Let's go, {HeroName}! {Hero.type=hero I know you can do it!|Just please don't backstab us, OK?}"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1285787431" "Oh, I've heard all about you, {HeroName}! {Hero.type=hero You're a hero for all of us!|You're... hh... well, pretty infamous in the Isles!} I've been told that you and I don't need to be involved with each other at the moment, but there may come a time where I have enough responsibilities to ask for the help of someone such as yourself!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3033962692" "Wow, I mean, this is something great! We saved a civilization in Praetoria! You'll be known for this one for a while, {HeroName}!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3717182362" "You've got a lot on your plate, don't forget them! I know I've forgotten plenty of stuff before. I think..."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Hero Text :
"P2594121416" "<color orange>When Number Six speaks, his voice has a sort of echo to it, as if it is reverberating against something.</color><br><br>Hello, {HeroName}! I'm glad you got my memo. I'm Dr. Michael Orts, but you can just call me Number Six! It's sort of my professional nickname.<br><br>Before you ask, yes, I am very... pixellated! It's due to a power I have, where I can turn myself into pixels and enter into computers!<br><br>Isn't it fascinating?"
// Answer Text :
"P19255957" "Wasn't there a reason you called me, Number Six?"
// Page Reason Text :
"P1240196150" "Oh, yes! Sorry, my mind sometimes has a hard time focusing, what with the pixels.<br><br>Yes, Vanguard is currently working on the evacuation of what we're calling the <color yellow>Final Bastion</color> in Praetoria. This was a place that several rogue IDF troops set up to be an outpost from Emperor Cole. The outpost was quite impressive, really! They had <color yellow>sonic fences</color> to keep the Hamidon back, along with <color yellow>turret schematics stolen from Lambda sector</color> to serve as their defense.<br><br>The civilization is falling, however; it <i>was</i> going to be our last outpost in Praetoria, but I don't think it's possible for us to recover it. We need you to help with the final evacuation, {HeroName}!<br><Br><color orange>You think things over for a moment. You've fought a god of <i>death</i> in Dark Astoria and helped push back the forces of Praetoria in Imperial City. You have the power to do more than help in an evacuation, you have the power to turn the tide and save this place and establish one last outpost in Praetoria!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1379838" "I'll help, but we're not going to abandon that civilization."
// Page Villaini24StoryArcMrGAlive Text :
"P1283496605" "<color orange>When Number Six speaks, his voice has a sort of echo to it, as if it is reverberating against something.</color><br><br>Hello, {HeroName}, my name is Number Six. Vanguard isn't too pleased with your actions, I have to say! I'm honestly a little nervous talking to you, hence why the pixels that make up my body are kind of sort of flying all over the place.<br><br>However, we're in a situation where we need help from someone as powerful as you. Lady Grey says that if you can help us with this scenario, she will overlook your previous attack on Vanguard.<br><br>We need your help with an evacuation of the last bastion of civilization in Praetoria. This was a place that several rogue IDF troops set up to be an outpost from Emperor Cole. The outpost was quite impressive, really! They had <color yellow>sonic fences</color> to keep the Hamidon back, along with <color yellow>turret schematics stolen from Lambda sector</color> to serve as their defense.<br><br>The civilization is falling, however; it <i>was</i> going to be our last outpost in Praetoria, but I don't think it's possible for us to recover it. We need you to help with the final evacuation, {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P2504046891" "(Think things over for a moment)"
// Page Villain1 Text :
"P4183303199" "<color orange>You're not too concerned with looking good in the eyes of Vanguard. However, this is a very unique opportunity. You've already been through plenty with your Incarnate powers. Dr. Orts says that this is the last hope for civilization in Praetoria. If you helped save this place, you could be seen as a <b>savior</b>. Such a title would grant you power, perhaps even <i>rule</i> over this civilization, once it was back up and running.<br><br>If you worked with Vanguard to do this, it could eventually lead to you becoming the new ruler of Praetoria, if you play your cards right!"
// Answer Text :
"P1339078948" "I'll help you, but we're not evacuating that civilization."
// Page Villain Text :
"P817995942" "<color orange>When Number Six speaks, his voice has a sort of echo to it, as if it is reverberating against something.</color><br><br><font outline=3>Hello, {HeroName}, my name is Number Six. Vanguard isn't too pleased with your actions as a villain, I have to say! I'm honestly a little nervous talking to you, hence why the pixels that make up my body are kind of sort of flying all over the place.<br><br>However, we're in a situation where we need help from someone as powerful as you.<br><br>We need your help with an evacuation of the last bastion of civilization in Praetoria. This was a place that several rogue IDF troops set up to be an outpost from Emperor Cole. The outpost was quite impressive, really! They had <color yellow>sonic fences</color> to keep the Hamidon back, along with <color yellow>turret schematics stolen from Lambda sector</color> to serve as their defense.<br><br>The civilization is falling, however; it <i>was</i> going to be our last outpost in Praetoria, but I don't think it's possible for us to recover it. We need you to help with the final evacuation, {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
// "P422957435" "(Think it through)"
// Page Villain2 Text :
"P801423931" "<color orange>You've already been through plenty with your Incarnate powers. Number Six says that this is the last hope for civilization in Praetoria. If you helped save this place, you could been seen as a <b>savior</b>. Such a title would grant you power, perhaps even <i>rule</i> over this civilization, once it was back up and running.<br><br>If you worked with Vanguard to do this, it could eventually lead to you becoming the new ruler of Praetoria, if you play your cards right!"
